      "title": "Clearing the FoG: Training KG Agents to Retrieve the Evidence Behind Their Answers",
      "topic": "agent",
      "language": [
        "zh",
        "en"
      ],
      "authors": [
        "Zongyuan Sun",
        "Shuai Zhao",
        "Yingjun Du",
        "Ke Shu",
        "Ziyue Zhu",
        "Haoran Luo"
      ],
      "institution": "Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications",
      "summary": {
        "zh": "本文针对LLM在事实问答中“有答案无证据”的问题，提出了FoG框架。通过构造带有天然证据链的合成数据以及设计激励证据检索的过程奖励机制，FoG成功训练了小参数量的KG代理同时实现高精度答案生成和高覆盖率证据检索。该方法有效清除了推理过程中的“迷雾”，提升了KG增强型LLM的可信度和可解释性，并在多个基准测试中超越了更大规模的模型。",
        "en": "- **Background**: Large Language Models (LLMs) often answer factual questions correctly but lack traceable evidence. In high-stakes domains like healthcare and law, users require verifiable evidence to trust the output."
      },
